<description>&lt;p&gt;Libyan armed forces continue extrajudicial executions and hold dozens of detainees at risk of execution, while Haftar's forces have signed a strategic cooperation protocol with Niger. An armed group shut the Hamada pipeline valve, halting crude supplies to the Zawiya refinery, and the PFG warned of possible disruption at the Al-Tahara oilfield. Jordan and Libya discussed joint military training, coordination and exchange of defense expertise, and Libya and Jordan also discussed developing military training and coordination. The NOC reported the valve closure, and the UCDP counted 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Devdiscourse&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxNWTEtRW9rNXQ2eDdSOVN0czJ3c3prOE05M1ZxdlhfSzh0TktTRE04cjNzdXNSZ1d2Ung1TW1BV3NBRFlZcFg3SF9qT21VcUJKRzVFRWxKSzhkcXJpWXNvRlFtQXhfZ1QyQlU1VEEyX1dpWHdhMV94c2dTeDhCb2VlZC1ScncwTUlTZG1TU1R5R1N4cTFmODhZQktFektPSXB2QlZkN205bGF6X0xwU3lRaUhLZDhIRUtNSjlaM3R3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Premier Christian News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxPZ3haWDZLZXNVejVMR280NTkwZlFxcXIzLUtTVVlQcXMxRzZqZThxXzF2VjNab3E4WDhhWk1qUTl0NXowV2tNUXZlLTYzVV9vbU1sZUVuTDB6N1I3X1lUNUxnWFFkRnVYUlhtd25DU1k2WGZXRHhCQnoyR1JJNXpVVnVxcF9EcGpyX1UwRDRRLU1MN2dhbC1uMGtkSUFpeUhWQTNJdF94NkU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Janes Defence Intelligence&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxOMW9SdWJSbHV6SFMxV1MzZ1ltTVA4T3V5NWpZcGUyX01YdEhMajAzajQ1YTdzWTA0VFBDQzQxa0t6WUd0UnRVSUJYbXZFQVNFS213ellnRjFpSGljR0NrYi04cDltTWpuZWhCbkxBNUFINXJsMjZ0ODBrWHRpX0xtcnA0czdnVFNfcGtTTXBKd3ZGX2k5ZHVONVRFV1k1NmU3dzNjUlB0cG4xZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Libya Update News - Libya Update News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUx